# Old Squarespace URLs -> new pages, so existing links and Google results keep working.
#
# NOTE: Cloudflare Pages already serves "/team" for "team.html" by itself, and
# redirects "/team.html" -> "/team". Do NOT add rules like "/team /team.html 200"
# here: they fight that behaviour and create an infinite redirect loop that takes
# down every page on the site. Point these at the extensionless paths.
/our-team          /team           301
/ccg-dealreports   /deal-reports   301
/apply-now         /apply          301
